*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0034
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-02-18 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 633
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0034.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 ACCOUNT-TYPE       PIC X.
       88 ACCOUNT-SAVINGS VALUE 'S'.
    *> CURRENT LEDGER BALANCE
    05 LEDGER-BAL         PIC 9(9)V99.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> APPLIED INTEREST RATE
    05 APPLIED-RATE       PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM SET-SAVINGS-RATE
    DISPLAY "APPLIED-RATE=" APPLIED-RATE
    STOP RUN.
SET-SAVINGS-RATE.
    IF ACCOUNT-SAVINGS AND LEDGER-BAL >= 75000
        MOVE 0.0425 TO APPLIED-RATE
    ELSE
        *> MIDDLE SAVINGS TIER
        IF ACCOUNT-SAVINGS AND LEDGER-BAL >= 20000
            MOVE 0.0325 TO APPLIED-RATE
        ELSE
            IF ACCOUNT-SAVINGS
                MOVE 0.0250 TO APPLIED-RATE
            ELSE
                MOVE 0.0100 TO APPLIED-RATE
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
